## Appendix I: Falsification Decision Matrix

### I.1 Purpose

This appendix provides a decision matrix for the F1–F8 falsification criteria described in Section 16.

### I.2 Decision matrix

| Criterion | Metric | Threshold | If violated | Result status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **F1** | Bootstrap consistency | > 90% | Report as U | Unresolved |
| **F1** | FDR correction | q < 0.05 | Report as U | Unresolved |
| **F2** | ILS simulation p-value | p < 0.01 | Downgrade | Compatible with ILS |
| **F3** | Reference bias simulation | p < 0.05 | Reject | Artifact |
| **F4** | SV enrichment (ANCOVA) | p < 0.05 | Unsupported | No independent evidence |
| **F4** | LD decay (ANCOVA) | p < 0.05 | Unsupported | No independent evidence |
| **F5** | Bayes factor | > 3 | Cannot discriminate | Report all models |
| **F5** | ABC-RF posterior | > 0.66 | Cannot discriminate | Report all models |
| **F6** | BUSCO completeness | > 90% | Provisional | Underpowered |
| **F6** | Chromosome-level assembly | Required | Provisional | Underpowered |
| **F7** | Ancestry accuracy | > 80% | Downgrade | Unresolved |
| **F7** | Inheritance-mode confusion | < 20% | Fix \(c_i\) | Simplified model |
| **F7** | \(\beta_r\) correlation | > 0.7 | External prior | Simplified model |
| **F8** | Ghost lineage simulation | p < 0.05 | Downgrade | Compatible with ghost |

### I.3 Result classification

| Result | Description | Conditions |
|---|---|---|
| **A** | Strong multi-lineage mosaic | All F1–F8 pass |
| **B** | Hybridization + introgression | F2–F5 pass, F8 pass |
| **C** | ILS-dominated | F2 fails |
| **D** | Insufficient resources | F6 fails for ≥2 lineages |

### I.4 Reporting

Results will be reported as:

1. **Falsification table** (F1–F8 status per ancestry block)
2. **Result classification** (A, B, C, or D)
3. **Unresolved regions** with reasons
4. **Confidence intervals** for all estimates

